        <p>Our coaching team will recommend the perfect first class based on your age, experience and goals.</p>
        <p class="font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-widest text-sm pt-2">No pressure. No commitment. Just a free introduction to Brazilian Jiu Jitsu.</p>
      </div>
      <button id="choose-quiz-open" type="button" class="inline-block bg-black hover:bg-black/80 text-white font-bold uppercase tracking-widest px-10 py-5 text-lg transition-transform hover:scale-105 border border-transparent hover:border-white/20">Help Me Choose My First Class →</button>
